      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEAVER MENZIES (4) impressed last time when clocked a strong 22.74 to finish second behind AKII ALEJANDRO in a new PB this course and distance. Going well and can measure up this time. AKII ALEJANDRO (1) produced a decent 22.72 when winning over 401m at this track last start. Expecting another bold showing. GEORGINA ROSE (2) is a handy type who was well below best latest at this track, finishing fourth (18.85) in a Grade 5. Normally safely away but always well back and facing a task from wide out last time. Deserves plenty of respect. LOCHINVAR CHIRON (3) found the frame here last start and looks a top-three hope again.",
